   20 XS%=28;REM 3.5/32*256   30 YS%=(2*256)/22;REM 2/22*256   40 YZ%=-1*256  100 FOR PY%=0 TO 21  110 XZ%=-2.5*256;Y2%=YZ%/16%  120 FOR PX%=0 TO 31  130 X%=0;Y%=0;X2%=XZ%/16%  140 FOR I%=0 TO 14  150 XQ%=X%*X%;YQ%=Y%*Y%  160 IF XQ%+YQ%>1024 THEN GOTO 230  170 XT% = (XQ%-YQ%)/16%+X2%  180 M% = X%*Y%  200 Y% = (M%+M%)/16%+Y2%  210 X% = XT%  220 NEXT I%  230 I%=I%-I;PRINT CHR(I%+33%),  240 XZ% = XZ%+XS%  250 NEXT PX%  260 PRINT CHR(13)  270 YZ% = YZ%+YS%  280 NEXT PY%END  230 I%=I%-I;PRINT 